Z||000002||A_Pegasi||12-21-2001||01:57 PM||||There are several companies producing aftermarket parts for the Fiero. You can get a cosidated book of the catalogs put out by some of these companies at <A HREF="http://www.cybercars.com/" TARGET=_blank>cybercars.com</A>. It's called the "BIG Fiero Parts Book" and it's published by PISA Corporation. PISA also has a line of kits and accessories to dress up your Fiero. P.S. Trying NOT to read like an advertisement for PISA, but I've found the parts book to be a great resource and the kits I've seen at shows looked darn good. Hope this helps.<P>------------------<BR><B>A_Pegasi</B><BR> <A HREF="mailto:RCHal486@aol.com">RCHal486@aol.com</A> ||||reg||1
